{"slug":"Universal-Script-Instant-Button-Click-OR-Hold-208228","_id":"69f05ccbffa7e4121e486f96","title":"Instant Button Click OR Hold V2.0","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"Only supported a built-in roblox touches. I will do for non roblox version touches any sooner if I had time. Yet the script is about 10 to 20. Yaa even you can create it by yourself with very few knowledge about lua. But I decided to share it here, maybe it became helpful for other. This script with the help with Gemini, meanwhile I can taught myself to learn Luau also :_)\n\nNot always work on some game I've tested like : 3008, Burger Cook,","tags":["universal","instant","touches","roblox","click"],"script":"\nlocal Players = game:GetService(\"Players\")\nlocal player = Players.LocalPlayer\n\nlocal function makePromptInstant(prompt)\n    if prompt:IsA(\"ProximityPrompt\") then\n        prompt.HoldDuration = 0                  \n        prompt.RequiresLineOfSight = false  \n        prompt.MaxActivationDistance = 10  \n    end\nend\n\nfor _, descendant in ipairs(workspace:GetDescendants()) do\n    makePromptInstant(descendant)\nend\n\nworkspace.DescendantAdded:Connect(function(descendant)\n    makePromptInstant(descendant)\nend)\n","owner":{"_id":"699198d5e15cc5a47fe1845b","username":"Gumaheroishere","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/39f8747cf9319efa1d80dd275000f893a8716055c6a5b93ec7d0d486c48e4f17.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/699198d5e15cc5a47fe1845b-1771149625057.png"},"status":"offline","id":"699198d5e15cc5a47fe1845b","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/39f8747cf9319efa1d80dd275000f893a8716055c6a5b93ec7d0d486c48e4f17.webp","original":"https://